# Wings of Gold (jeuno 60), the Upper Delkfutt's Tower chest without the bell (the treasure trade gives it; noAction).
# An opened chest leaves for a while, so this side is its own flow. Then the Middle tower chest with the bell held (nil:
# the chest's own script opens it).
lists UpperDelkfuttsTower/Treasure_Chest/onTrade MiddleDelkfuttsTower/Treasure_Chest/onTrade
char zone=UpperDelkfuttsTower pos=-300,-175.924,20 job=BST lvl=40
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster completed
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold accepted
item DelkfuttChestKey x2
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest
trade Treasure_Chest DelkfuttChestKey x1    # no bell: the treasure trade, bypass 2: the Guiding Bell; noAction
tick 4500                                   # the Guiding Bell
warp -40,-47.852,90 MiddleDelkfuttsTower
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest
trade Treasure_Chest DelkfuttChestKey x1    # the bell held: nil; the chest's own script opens it
tick 4500
